                                                "text": "tight budget"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "88a92317-98f4-46ec-9ed7-20e51b31e5f7",
                                                "sense_id": "643806b6-a4c6-34f7-80ca-221e4afdddaa",
                                                "text": "within the budget"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "31c6536b-71cf-428a-b0d0-269525ec14bf",
                                                "sense_id": "643806b6-a4c6-34f7-80ca-221e4afdddaa",
                                                "text": "over the budget"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2136e8b0-30db-4138-9339-49ff550c7fb4",
                                                "sense_id": "643806b6-a4c6-34f7-80ca-221e4afdddaa",
                                                "text": "At the other extreme, with limitless budgets all they have to do is dream up amazing lighting rigs to be constructed and operated by the huge team of gaffers and sparks, with their generators, discharge lights, flags, gobos and brutes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3ba85218-61f5-4ca3-b59a-f0ec679a42b9",
                                                "sense_id": "643806b6-a4c6-34f7-80ca-221e4afdddaa",
                                                "text": "The latest Tory budget continued the trend begun in 2000 by making further small cuts in family income taxes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a959cbbf-5900-42ff-bf69-84375e2702e9",
                                                "sense_id": "643806b6-a4c6-34f7-80ca-221e4afdddaa",
                                                "text": "The most common poly budget in use for games at the time of this writing is between 5,000 and 10,000 tris."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f2918e71-45f6-371c-9e76-dbfe8a4bbcd2",
                                        "entry_id": "73753c13-df8c-340f-a9f2-dd45929a2da1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The amount of money or resources earmarked for a particular institution, activity or timeframe.",
                                            "A relatively small amount of available money."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6ece8e7a-ce49-4ec6-8660-926bb96d35c3",
                                                "sense_id": "f2918e71-45f6-371c-9e76-dbfe8a4bbcd2",
                                                "text": "We're on a budget, so we can't afford to eat at that restaurant."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e86b7332-5780-3cbe-9a0e-4bc20338ceb0",
                                        "entry_id": "73753c13-df8c-340f-a9f2-dd45929a2da1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An itemized summary of intended expenditure; usually coupled with expected revenue."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "17f45c7c-d166-32f8-b636-3e7be247eb8a",
                                        "entry_id": "73753c13-df8c-340f-a9f2-dd45929a2da1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A wallet, purse or bag."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "65e90d3c-0d7e-4c46-9bcd-805e6281843f",
                                                "sense_id": "17f45c7c-d166-32f8-b636-3e7be247eb8a",
                                                "text": "With that out of his bouget forth he drew / Great store of treasure, therewith him to tempt […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "691c6396-c80a-44c2-acf8-5ee6d3c85622",
                                                "sense_id": "17f45c7c-d166-32f8-b636-3e7be247eb8a",
                                                "text": "The king holds up a hand to the lute player: ‘Thank you, leave us.’ The boy stuffs his music back into his budget and goes out backwards."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1daec9b2-d3dd-3e87-b6bf-6cf4ffa95689",
                                        "entry_id": "73753c13-df8c-340f-a9f2-dd45929a2da1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A compact collection of things."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "895e4ed9-6663-4a31-bbec-25ab1138f962",
                                                "sense_id": "1daec9b2-d3dd-3e87-b6bf-6cf4ffa95689",
                                                "text": "I set off, therefore, in high spirits, for I felt that I had done good work and was bringing back a fine budget of news for my companions."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2f02122e-e813-3700-9d3d-a8b658bd0088",
                                        "entry_id": "73753c13-df8c-340f-a9f2-dd45929a2da1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A socket in which the end of a cavalry carbine rests."
                                        ],
